      "tr": "jinish",
      "en": "thing"
    },
    {
      "id": "shobcheye",
      "bn": "সবচেয়ে",
      "tr": "shobcheye",
      "en": "the most",
      "notes": "সবচেয়ে + adjective = superlative: সবচেয়ে ভালো \"the best\", সবচেয়ে সস্তা \"the cheapest\"."
    }
  ],
